ogy-sequence-to-the-corresponding-long-exact-sequence","cor-homology-of-a-degreewise-split-direct-sum-sequence","cor-short-five-lemma-for-quasi-isomorphisms","prop-a-short-exact-sequence-of-complexes-gives-six-term-exact-sequences-when-homology-is-concentrated-in-two-degrees","def-homological-delta-functor-carried-by-homology-of-complexes","prop-homology-of-complexes-satisfies-the-delta-functor-naturality-and-exactness-laws","fs-the-connecting-morphism-is-defined-by-choosing-one-lift-with-no-independence-proof","fs-a-degreewise-split-short-exact-sequence-of-complexes-has-zero-connecting-map","fs-the-homology-functor-is-exact-on-short-exact-sequences-of-complexes","fs-the-cohomology-connecting-morphism-lowers-degree","fs-naturality-of-the-long-exact-sequence-follows-without-checking-the-connecting-square","ex-the-connecting-map-for-a-short-exact-sequence-of-two-term-complexes","ex-a-degreewise-split-sequence-with-nonzero-connecting-map","ex-the-cone-long-exact-sequence-for-multiplication-by-m","ex-two-out-of-three-for-a-diagram-of-finite-complexes","ex-a-six-term-cohomology-sequence","cex-homology-is-not-an-exact-functor","ex-naturality-of-a-connecting-map-under-a-map-of-coefficient-sequences","ex-relative-homology-of-a-composable-pair-of-stalk-complexes"],"conventions":[{"convention":"Right closed means that $-\\otimes X$ has right adjoint $[X,-]$; left closed means that $X\\otimes-$ has right adjoint $\\langle X,-\\rangle$.","fixed_by":"def-left-closed-and-right-closed-monoidal-category","matters_for":["def-the-internal-hom-and-its-evaluation-morphism","thm-in-a-symmetric-monoidal-category-the-two-closures-agree","thm-the-internal-hom-is-continuous-in-each-variable","thm-the-internal-hom-composition-morphism","thm-the-unit-is-an-internal-hom-unit","fs-the-left-and-right-internal-homs-agree-in-every-monoidal-category","ex-the-internal-hom-of-abelian-groups"]},{"convention":"A system of parameters in a $d$-dimensional Noetherian local ring has exactly $d$ entries and maximal radical; in dimension zero the empty tuple is used.","fixed_by":"def-system-of-parameters-and-parameter-ideal","matters_for":["lem-parameter-ideal-equivalent-m-primary","lem-parameter-dimension-drop-is-exact","thm-existence-of-systems-of-parameters","thm-dimension-as-minimal-number-of-radical-generators","cor-dimension-drops-under-a-parameter","ex-system-of-parameters-not-a-minimal-generating-set"]},{"convention":"The homological connecting morphism has degree $-1$: $\\partial_n:H_n(C)\\to H_{n-1}(A)$.","fixed_by":"def-connecting-morphism-in-homology","matters_for":["thm-long-exact-sequence-in-homology","thm-naturality-of-the-homology-connecting-morphism","thm-the-cone-long-exact-sequence","prop-the-cone-connecting-map-agrees-with-the-shifted-identity-up-to-the-declared-sign","fs-the-cohomology-connecting-morphism-lowers-degree"]},{"convention":"Cochain complexes are reindexed by $(C^\\sharp)_n=C^{-n}$, so their connecting map has degree $+1$: $\\partial^n:H^n(C)\\to H^{n+1}(A)$.","fixed_by":"thm-long-exact-sequence-in-cohomology","matters_for":["thm-naturality-of-the-cohomology-connecting-morphism","fs-the-cohomology-connecting-morphism-lowers-degree","ex-a-six-term-cohomology-sequence"]}],"load_bearing":[{"id":"lem-principal-ideal-theorem-associated-prime-step","statement":"Let $(R,\\mathfrak m)$ be a Noetherian local domain, and let $x\\in\\mathfrak m$ be nonzero. If $\\mathfrak m$ is minimal over $(x)$, then every prime ideal strictly contained in $\\mathfrak m$ is zero. In particular $\\operatorname{ht}(\\mathfrak m)\\le 1$.","used_by":["thm-krull-principal-ideal-theorem"]},{"id":"thm-krull-principal-ideal-theorem","statement":"Let $R$ be a Noetherian commutative ring, let $x\\in R$, and let $\\mathfrak p$ be a prime ideal minimal over $(x)$. Then $\\operatorname{ht}(\\mathfrak p)\\le1$.","used_by":["cor-minimal-prime-over-a-nonzerodivisor-has-height-one","lem-height-theorem-first-generator-reduction","thm-krull-height-theorem"]},{"id":"thm-krull-height-theorem","statement":"Let $R$ be a Noetherian commutative ring, let $I=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)$ be generated by $n\\ge1$ elements, and let $\\mathfrak p$ be minimal over $I$. Then $\\operatorname{ht}(\\mathfrak p)\\le n$.","used_by":["cor-height-of-a-prime-bounded-by-minimal-number-of-generators","lem-height-converse-parameter-selection","lem-parameter-dimension-drop-is-exact","thm-dimension-as-minimal-number-of-radical-generators","ex-height-theorem-bound-sharp"]},{"id":"thm-dimension-formula-for-affine-domains","statement":"For a finite-type $k$-domain $A$ and $\\mathfrak p\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(A)$, $\\operatorname{ht}(\\mathfrak p)+\\operatorname{trdeg}_k\\operatorname{Frac}(A/\\mathfrak p)=\\operatorname{trdeg}_k\\operatorname{Frac}(A)$.","used_by":["lem-affine-domain-chain-dimension-formula-step","cor-height-plus-quotient-dimension-affine-domain","cor-maximal-chains-in-affine-domains-have-equal-length","ex-affine-dimension-formula"]},{"id":"def-left-closed-and-right-closed-monoidal-category","statement":"Defines right closed, left closed, and biclosed monoidal categories by the two tensor functors having right adjoints.","used_by":["thm-the-internal-hom-is-unique-up-to-unique-natural-isomorphism","def-the-internal-hom-and-its-evaluation-morphism","cex-a-monoidal-category-need-not-be-closed","thm-a-closed-monoidal-category-has-its-tensor-cocontinuous-in-each-variable","fs-the-left-and-right-internal-homs-agree-in-every-monoidal-category"]},{"id":"def-locally-cartesian-closed-category","statement":"A category $\\mathcal C$ is locally cartesian closed when every slice $\\mathcal C/X$ is cartesian closed.","used_by":["thm-slices-of-a-locally-cartesian-closed-category-are-locally-cartesian-closed","thm-a-locally-cartesian-closed-category-with-a-terminal-object-is-cartesian-closed","thm-a-locally-cartesian-closed-category-has-pullbacks-and-with-a-terminal-object-all-finite-limits","thm-local-cartesian-closure-is-equivalent-to-every-pullback-functor-having-a-right-adjoint","thm-set-is-locally-cartesian-closed"]},{"id":"def-connecting-morphism-in-homology","statement":"The connecting morphism $\\partial_n:H_n(C)\\to H_{n-1}(A)$ is the unique map induced by the preconnecting arrow on cycles.","used_by":["thm-long-exact-sequence-in-homology","thm-naturality-of-the-homology-connecting-morphism","prop-the-connecting-morphism-vanishes-for-a-chain-split-short-exact-sequence","def-homological-delta-functor-carried-by-homology-of-complexes"]},{"id":"thm-long-exact-sequence-in-homology","statement":"Every short exact sequence of complexes in an abelian category gives the displayed bi-infinite long exact homology sequence.","used_by":["thm-long-exact-sequence-in-cohomology","cor-a-short-exact-sequence-with-acyclic-middle-identifies-neighbouring-homology","cor-two-out-of-three-for-acyclicity-in-a-short-exact-sequence-of-complexes","thm-the-cone-long-exact-sequence","prop-a-short-exact-sequence-of-complexes-gives-six-term-exact-sequences-when-homology-is-concentrated-in-two-degrees","prop-homology-of-complexes-satisfies-the-delta-functor-naturality-and-exactness-laws"]}],"published_dependencies":[{"id":"cor-contravariant-yoneda-lemma","used_for":"Prerequisite for thm-a-presheaf-category-on-a-small-category-is-cartesian-closed.","opened":true},{"id":"cor-integral-extension-lifts-finite-prime-chains","used_for":"Prerequisite for lem-affine-domain-normalisation-dimension-lower-bound.","opened":true},{"id":"cor-left-adjoints-preserve-colimits","used_for":"Prerequisite for thm-a-closed-monoidal-category-has-its-tensor-cocontinuous-in-each-variable and cor-a-cartesian-closed-category-with-an-initial-object-has-strict-initial-objects.","opened":true},{"id":"cor-noether-normalisation-module-finiteness","used_for":"Prerequisite for thm-affine-domain-dimension-transcendence-degree.","opened":true},{"id":"cor-polynomial-ring-over-a-field-is-a-pid","used_for":"Prerequisite for lem-polynomial-prime-contraction-height-jump-at-most-one and lem-polynomial-ri